// Componentes visuais da área fiscal (mesmo desenho do Módulo Fiscal do app React, cartões arredondados e
// rótulos em caixa alta). Só cores do Theme: funcionam no tema claro e no escuro.

import { Theme } from "../theme.slint";
import { Icon } from "../icons.slint";
export { Icon }

// Cor de destaque de cada cartão/tela (o React usava amber, emerald, indigo, violet, sky, rose, blue).
export enum FxCor { ambar, verde, azul, roxo, vermelho, laranja, neutro }

export global FxCores {
    public pure function de(c: FxCor) -> color {
        if c == FxCor.ambar { return Theme.closing; }
        if c == FxCor.verde { return Theme.available; }
        if c == FxCor.azul { return Theme.occupied; }
        if c == FxCor.roxo { return Theme.purple; }
        if c == FxCor.vermelho { return Theme.danger; }
        if c == FxCor.laranja { return Theme.orange; }
        return Theme.text-muted;
    }
}

export component FxLabel inherits Text {
    color: Theme.text-muted;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
}

export component FxCard inherits Rectangle {
    background: Theme.surface;
    border-radius: 22px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: Theme.border;
}

export component FxBadge inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> text;
    in property <FxCor> cor: FxCor.ambar;
    height: 22px;
    width: badge-text.preferred-width + 16px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: FxCores.de(root.cor).with-alpha(0.15);
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: FxCores.de(root.cor).with-alpha(0.35);
    badge-text := Text {
        text: root.text;
        color: FxCores.de(root.cor);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    }
}

export enum FxBotao { normal, primario, perigo, sucesso, fantasma }

export component FxButton inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> text;
    in property <image> icone;
    in property <FxBotao> tipo: FxBotao.normal;
    in property <bool> enabled: true;
    in property <bool> busy;
    in property <length> font-size: 14px;
    callback clicked;
    property <color> cor: root.tipo == FxBotao.primario ? Theme.primary
        : root.tipo == FxBotao.perigo ? Theme.danger
        : root.tipo == FxBotao.sucesso ? Theme.available
        : Theme.surface-2;
    min-height: 42px;
    min-width: conteudo.preferred-width + 30px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    opacity: root.enabled && !root.busy ? 1 : 0.5;
    background: root.tipo == FxBotao.fantasma ? (touch.has-hover ? Theme.surface-2 : transparent)
        : root.tipo == FxBotao.normal ? (touch.has-hover ? Theme.border : Theme.surface-2)
        : (touch.has-hover ? root.cor.brighter(0.12) : root.cor);
    border-width: root.tipo == FxBotao.normal || root.tipo == FxBotao.fantasma ? 1px : 0;
    border-color: Theme.border;
    property <color> cor-texto: root.tipo == FxBotao.primario ? Theme.primary-text
        : root.tipo == FxBotao.perigo || root.tipo == FxBotao.sucesso ? #ffffff
        : Theme.text;
    conteudo := HorizontalLayout {
        alignment: center;
        spacing: 8px;
        if root.icone.width > 0: VerticalLayout {
            alignment: center;
            Icon { source: root.icone; color: root.cor-texto; size: root.font-size + 2px; }
        }
        Text {
            text: root.busy ? "Aguarde..." : root.text;
            font-size: root.font-size;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: root.cor-texto;
            vertical-alignment: center;
        }
    }
    touch := TouchArea {
        enabled: root.enabled && !root.busy;
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => { root.clicked(); }
    }
}

// Campo de texto de uma linha
export component FxInput inherits Rectangle {
    in-out property <string> text <=> input.text;
    in property <string> placeholder;
    in property <length> font-size: 14px;
    in property <bool> mono;
    in property <bool> error;
    in property <bool> enabled: true;
    in property <bool> senha;
    in property <TextHorizontalAlignment> align: left;
    out property <bool> has-focus: input.has-focus;
    callback accepted();
    callback edited(string);
    callback key-pressed(KeyEvent) -> EventResult;
    public function select-all() { input.select-all(); }

    forward-focus: input;
    min-height: 42px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: root.error ? Theme.danger : input.has-focus ? Theme.primary : Theme.border;
    background: root.enabled ? Theme.bg : Theme.surface-2;
    TouchArea { mouse-cursor: MouseCursor.text; clicked => { input.focus(); } }
    HorizontalLayout {
        padding-left: 14px;
        padding-right: 14px;
        Rectangle {
            Text {
                x: 0;
                width: 100%;
                text: input.text == "" ? root.placeholder : "";
                color: Theme.text-muted;
                font-size: root.font-size;
                vertical-alignment: center;
                horizontal-alignment: root.align;
                overflow: elide;
            }
            input := TextInput {
                width: 100%;
                enabled: root.enabled;
                color: Theme.text;
                font-size: root.font-size;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-family: root.mono ? "Menlo" : "";
                vertical-alignment: center;
                horizontal-alignment: root.align;
                single-line: true;
                input-type: root.senha ? InputType.password : InputType.text;
                selection-background-color: Theme.primary.with-alpha(0.4);
                accepted => { root.accepted(); }
                edited => { root.edited(self.text); }
                key-pressed(event) => { return root.key-pressed(event); }
            }
        }
    }
}

// Texto de várias linhas (justificativas)
export component FxTextArea inherits Rectangle {
    in-out property <string> text <=> input.text;
    in property <string> placeholder;
    in property <length> altura: 84px;
    callback edited(string);
    forward-focus: input;
    height: root.altura;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: input.has-focus ? Theme.primary : Theme.border;
    background: Theme.bg;
    TouchArea { mouse-cursor: MouseCursor.text; clicked => { input.focus(); } }
    Text {
        x: 14px;
        y: 10px;
        width: parent.width - 28px;
        text: input.text == "" ? root.placeholder : "";
        color: Theme.text-muted;
        font-size: 13px;
        wrap: word-wrap;
    }
    input := TextInput {
        x: 14px;
        y: 10px;
        width: parent.width - 28px;
        height: parent.height - 20px;
        color: Theme.text;
        font-size: 13px;
        wrap: word-wrap;
        single-line: false;
        selection-background-color: Theme.primary.with-alpha(0.4);
        edited => { root.edited(self.text); }
    }
}

// Campo com rótulo em cima
export component FxField inherits VerticalLayout {
    in property <string> label;
    spacing: 6px;
    FxLabel { text: root.label; }
    @children
}

// Faixa de resultado (verde = sucesso, vermelho = erro, âmbar = aviso)
export component FxAviso inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> text;
    in property <FxCor> cor: FxCor.verde;
    in property <image> icone;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: FxCores.de(root.cor).with-alpha(0.12);
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: FxCores.de(root.cor).with-alpha(0.35);
    HorizontalLayout {
        padding: 12px;
        padding-left: 14px;
        padding-right: 14px;
        spacing: 10px;
        if root.icone.width > 0: VerticalLayout {
            alignment: start;
            Icon { source: root.icone; color: FxCores.de(root.cor); size: 16px; }
        }
        Text {
            text: root.text;
            color: FxCores.de(root.cor);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            wrap: word-wrap;
            vertical-alignment: center;
            horizontal-stretch: 1;
        }
    }
}

// Cabeçalho das telas internas: voltar, título, subtítulo e ações à direita
export component FxHeader inherits HorizontalLayout {
    in property <string> titulo;
    in property <string> subtitulo;
    in property <FxCor> cor: FxCor.ambar;
    callback voltar;
    spacing: 14px;
    alignment: stretch;
    Rectangle {
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: back.has-hover ? Theme.surface-2 : Theme.surface;
        border-width: 1px;
        border-color: Theme.border;
        Icon { source: @image-url("../../assets/icons/arrow-left.svg"); color: Theme.text; size: 20px; }
        back := TouchArea { mouse-cursor: pointer; clicked => { root.voltar(); } }
    }
    VerticalLayout {
        alignment: center;
        spacing: 2px;
        horizontal-stretch: 1;
        Text { text: root.titulo; color: Theme.text; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; wrap: word-wrap; }
        if root.subtitulo != "": Text { text: root.subtitulo; color: Theme.text-muted; font-size: 13px; wrap: word-wrap; }
    }
    @children
}

// Fundo escurecido + painel central (modais da área fiscal)
export component FxSheet inherits Rectangle {
    in property <length> largura: 560px;
    in property <string> titulo;
    in property <string> subtitulo;
    in property <FxCor> cor: FxCor.ambar;
    in property <image> icone;
    callback fechar;
    background: Theme.overlay;
    TouchArea { }
    Rectangle {
        width: min(root.largura, root.width - 32px);
        height: min(corpo.preferred-height, root.height - 32px);
        background: Theme.surface;
        border-radius: 24px;
        border-width: 1px;
        border-color: Theme.border;
        clip: true;
        corpo := VerticalLayout {
            padding: 24px;
            spacing: 16px;
            HorizontalLayout {
                spacing: 12px;
                if root.icone.width > 0: Rectangle {
                    width: 44px;
                    height: 44px;
                    border-radius: 14px;
                    background: FxCores.de(root.cor).with-alpha(0.12);
                    border-width: 1px;
                    border-color: FxCores.de(root.cor).with-alpha(0.3);
                    Icon { source: root.icone; color: FxCores.de(root.cor); size: 20px; }
                }
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    horizontal-stretch: 1;
                    Text { text: root.titulo; color: Theme.text; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 900; wrap: word-wrap; }
                    if root.subtitulo != "": Text { text: root.subtitulo; color: Theme.text-muted; font-size: 13px; wrap: word-wrap; }
                }
                Rectangle {
                    width: 34px;
                    height: 34px;
                    border-radius: 10px;
                    background: x-touch.has-hover ? Theme.surface-2 : transparent;
                    Icon { source: @image-url("../../assets/icons/x.svg"); color: Theme.text-muted; size: 18px; }
                    x-touch := TouchArea { mouse-cursor: pointer; clicked => { root.fechar(); } }
                }
            }
            @children
        }
    }
}

// Opção selecionável (formas de pagamento, ambiente, filtros)
export component FxOpcao inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> text;
    in property <bool> ativo;
    in property <FxCor> cor: FxCor.verde;
    callback clicked;
    min-height: 44px;
    min-width: op-text.preferred-width + 24px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: root.ativo ? FxCores.de(root.cor) : Theme.border;
    background: root.ativo ? FxCores.de(root.cor).with-alpha(0.14) : (t.has-hover ? Theme.surface-2 : Theme.bg);
    op-text := Text {
        text: root.text;
        color: root.ativo ? FxCores.de(root.cor) : Theme.text-muted;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 800;
    }
    t := TouchArea { mouse-cursor: pointer; clicked => { root.clicked(); } }
}
